'''Dukaan''' is a [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest|dragon priest]] entombed within [[Skyrim:White Ridge Sanctum|White Ridge Sanctum]] in [[Skyrim:Solstheim|Solstheim]]. He carries an [[Skyrim:Dukaan (item)|eponymous mask]].

He is a frost-based dragon priest, able to cast [[Skyrim:Frost Cloak|Frost Cloak]] and a unique spell called [[Skyrim:Frost Stream|Frost Stream]], which is similar to the [[Skyrim:Frost Breath|Frost Breath]] shout. He also uses the spells [[Skyrim:Ebonyflesh|Ebonyflesh]], [[Skyrim:Greater Ward|Greater Ward]], and a unique version of the new spell [[Skyrim:Conjure Seeker|Conjure Seeker]], which specifically summons a [[Skyrim:High Seeker|high seeker]].

